        <mxCell id="c52" value="&lt;i&gt;Order lines are counted by the fiscal year of their order date. The end date of each list is in its label, and none of the lists has a successor. Every one of the 1,841 order lines that cite list 4 counts, because its end date is before its start date.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="450" width="860" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
